 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Nazareth the angel came to a girl pledged to be wed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Greetings, you who are favored, the Lord is with you, he said",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She was troubled at his words, but he told her not to be afraid",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She would bear the Son of the Most High, whose kingdom will not fade",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the Lord's servant",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May it be to me according to your word",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My soul magnifies the Lord",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And my spirit rejoices in God my Savior",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For he has looked upon the humble state of his servant",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Holy is his name",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Bethlehem she laid her son down in a manger bed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The shepherds came and told the word that the angel said",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mary treasured up all these things",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And pondered them in her heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My soul magnifies the Lord",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And my spirit rejoices in God my Savior",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For he has looked upon the humble state of his servant",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Holy is his name",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Years later by the cross of Jesus, there his mother stood",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the disciple whom he loved, beneath the cruel wood",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Woman, here is your son",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is your mother",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His mercy extends to those who fear him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
